+ * negative error codes:
+ *
+ * :enum:`nghttp2_error.NGHTTP2_ERR_NOMEM`
+ *     Out of memory
+ * :enum:`nghttp2_error.NGHTTP2_ERR_INVALID_STATE`
+ *     The function is called from server side session
+ * :enum:`nghttp2_error.NGHTTP2_ERR_INVALID_ARGUMENT`
